<title>USA: Greenbrier gets $50 mln-plus railcar order.</title>
<headline>Greenbrier gets $50 mln-plus railcar order.</headline>
<dateline>LAKE OSWEGO, Ore. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Greenbrier Cos said Thursday it had received an order worth more than $50 million for 1,000 railcars to be leased to Canadian National Railway Co.</p>
<p>All cars will be built by the third quarter, it said.</p>
<p>The order includes 600 covered hopper cars to be built at the company's TrentonWorks facility in Nova Scotia, and 400 center-partition lumber cars to be built at it Gunderson facility in Portland, Ore.</p>
